ValidationRule.errorConditionFormula:
/* VR_Account_Merge_Completeness Fires when the Account is missing any of the three fields required for merge completeness. Each scenario is evaluated independently and the results are combined with OR so that a single missing field is enough to block the save (any-of logic across the three scenarios). */ OR( /* Scenario 1 (Region): Region is required so the surviving merged record can be routed correctly within regional reporting and ownership hierarchies. */ AND( true, ISBLANK( Region__c ) ),
/* Scenario 2 (Segment): Segment is required to preserve customer segmentation classification through the merge. Segment__c is a restricted picklist, so TEXT() + ISBLANK() is used to reliably detect an unselected value on both insert and update. */ AND( true, ISBLANK( TEXT( Segment__c ) ) ),
/* Scenario 3 (Account External Id): Account_Ext_Id__c is required so downstream systems and Copado ADD can continue to trace and reconcile the surviving record after the merge completes. */ AND( true, ISBLANK( Account_Ext_Id__c ) ) )
